#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:1
#: 0df97bafce514ef3a3b1d695d58ab612
msgid "ARX Lift 2S"
msgstr "方舟无限 Lift 2S"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:3
#: dfa12242c6744f5a89d36e51b0d55ca6
msgid ""
"**ARX** (方舟无限) is the brand. **Lift 2S** is that brand’s full-body "
"**mobile manipulator**: arms **plus** lift axis and **mobile base / "
"chassis**, not an arm-only robot."
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限**（ARX）是品牌。**Lift 2S** 是该品牌的全身 **移动操作臂**：手臂 **加上** 升降轴和 "
"**移动底盘**，不是仅机械臂的机器人。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:5
#: 25484b4e9ecb407a867f477453b33256
msgid ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** is **dual-arm**. It is not the Lift 2S platform. "
"The `arx-lift2s` workspace can launch Acone from `quick_start` for co-"
"debug; the product focus of that branch is Lift 2S."
msgstr ""
"**Acone** / **AC One** 是 **双臂**。它不是 Lift 2S 整机。`arx-lift2s` 工作空间可在 "
"`quick_start` 中启动 Acone 做联调；该分支的产品重点是 Lift 2S。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:7
#: 4c8ab67a6bdd43aa8de6b1acb3d79f9e
msgid "Source of truth"
msgstr "事实来源"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md:10
#: a4c31c6f28874217ab8999efe925e84c
msgid "Follow the branch README. Launch flags are those listed there."
msgstr "遵循分支 README。launch 参数以其中列出的为准。"

